' Change 1662: #option StartupMethodsDisabled, PIC16 (enhanced midrange), with Random.
' Expected (build 1662): ";!  call INITSYS" and ";!  call INITRANDOM" in the asm, and no INITSYS or INITRANDOM
' routine. Build 1661 compiled both although they were never called.
#chip 16F1829, 32
#option explicit
#option StartupMethodsDisabled

Dir PORTC Out
Randomize 0x1234
Do
    PORTC = Random
    Wait 100 ms
Loop
